				<wikidot:authorName>PyroGothNerd</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1808976</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Technically the murder bit has never been confirmed and seems unlikely given the little heart on its face in its entry every time it takes something away. For all we know, it could be taking its victims away to a land of ponies and butterflies where everyone eats chocolate and poops gold, and then putting them on display in the &quot;Things that know about ME&quot; exhibit of a local museum.</p> <p>Or, just put them in a dark cave and force them to talk about him 24/7</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
